<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovakia posts SKK 25.5bln 96 state budget deficit.</title>
<headline>Slovakia posts SKK 25.5bln 96 state budget deficit.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovakia's 1996 state budget deficit totalled 25.5 billion crowns, against a planned deficit of 27 billion crowns, the Ministry of Finance said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;The ministry revised its preliminary figures, after the National Bank of Slovakia's recent profit allocation,&quot; ministry spokesman Jozef Mach told Reuters.</p>
<p>In 1995, the state budget deficit totalled 8.3 billion crowns.</p>
</text>
